WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Huddle Board makes flag football easier to explain.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Pick a play, turn your tablet around, and let the kids watch it happen.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Blue and orange sides and clear animated routes make each job easy to see.

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.500
